oopener\" target=\"_blank\">Phoenix WinNonlin®</a>, <a href=\"/software/phoenix-pkpd/phoenix-cloud/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Phoenix® Cloud</a></p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row  top_padding_phone_24px\" id=\"fws_6aeb736dd481b\" style=\"padding-bottom: 8px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column centered-text no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #212b3b; line-height: 34px; text-align: left;\">Summary</h2>\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div><div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6aeb736dd4b80\" style=\"padding-bottom: 24px;\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column no-extra-padding no-extra-padding_tablet no-extra-padding_phone \">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>The slowest part of a regulatory submission isn’t the science. It’s everything between the science and the submission. Each step from data reception to standardized reporting is a handoff between people and tools, and the resulting delay is costly. Industry benchmarks put even the most efficient sponsors at eight to twelve weeks from lock to filing. Each month spent pre-market carries an opportunity cost of $60 million in NPV.</p>\n<p>Phoenix is changing that. By putting AI to work where it belongs (e.g., automating repetitive tasks, providing scientific recommendations, orchestrating workflows), our solutions will transform raw study data into a submission-ready deliverable in under a day. You state the goal. Phoenix asks for context, then recommends and builds the workflow. You adjust and refine. The result is fast, fully inspectable, repeatable, and built on the platform regulators have trusted for decades.</p>\n<p>Join us for an exploration of the Phoenix AI roadmap. You’ll get a sneak peek at how plain language prompts will soon offer bursts of speed in the analysis workflow, with no loss of control or quality.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div> \n\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-6 sticky-20 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay-wrap column-bg-layer\"><div class=\"column-bg-overlay\" style=\"background-color: #faf7f7;\"></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row\" id=\"fws_6aeb736dd4ee1\"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\"> <div class=\"row-bg\"></div> </div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left\">\n\t<div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col child_column tl_br_15px tr_br_15px bl_br_0px br_br_0px left_padding_desktop_40px left_padding_phone_24px top_padding_desktop_40px top_padding_phone_24px right_padding_desktop_40px right_padding_phone_24px bottom_padding_desktop_40px bottom_padding_phone_24px \" style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"column-image-bg-wrap column-bg-layer viewport-desktop\"><div class=\"inner-wrap\"><div class=\"column-image-bg\"></div></div></div>\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading Source-serif-text\" style=\"font-size: 30px; color: #ffffff; line-height: 34px; text-ali